[{"title":"醉为夏将军题画鹰 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"凤皇具九苞，是为众羽王。\n鹰鹯有劲翮，乃亦健翱翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉为夏将军题画鹰 其四","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"百中巧争能，一呼眦欲裂。\n眼底无秋毫，空中有毛血。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜啼鸟","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"不有夜啼鸟，谁怜夜啼妇。\n夜啼惊郎眠，不似妾眠苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33112,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉杯","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"鹦鹉海上杯，一酌起云雾。\n最得五柳欢，那免三闾妒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33113,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"药洲杂咏","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"手把绿玉杖，脚踏青芒鞋。\n采药不觉暮，晚风山气佳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33114,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄与东鹪鹩园杂咏 其一 学圃","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"朝来种茗去，日暮条桑归。\n时遇邻溪叟，高谈园杏肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33115,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄与东鹪鹩园杂咏 其二 襭芳台","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"空台数馀武，乱石郁崟欹。\n欲肆幽兰采，芳馨当赠谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33116,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄与东鹪鹩园杂咏 其三 竹径","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"一径翳丛篁，人家在深处。\n俗者不肯来，清者不肯去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33117,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳后二日何瑞虞龙周勚何龙友家霞举幼度桢卿有开文度集紫芝园席上各赋七言四律醉后又以客兼才子会乐任主人为十字为韵各赋 其一 客字","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"疏竹敞孤亭，亭空雨云黑。\n聊因吊楚骚，得见小山客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳后二日何瑞虞龙周勚何龙友家霞举幼度桢卿有开文度集紫芝园席上各赋七言四律醉后又以客兼才子会乐任主人为十字为韵各赋 其二 才字","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"绿野孤亭色，青云众妙才。\n可能双宝剑，不为故人开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳后二日何瑞虞龙周勚何龙友家霞举幼度桢卿有开文度集紫芝园席上各赋七言四律醉后又以客兼才子会乐任主人为十字为韵各赋 其三 主字","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"临风弄清弦，长林不知暑。\n故知山水间，闲者便是主。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何文徵山斋杂咏 其一 鸟鸣涧","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"粼粼涧中石，嘉木郁繁阴。\n好鸟时相和，悠然静者心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何文徵山斋杂咏 其二 杜若洲","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"飘飘水中洲，杜若秋渐长。\n暗香洒寒流，时激清泠响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33122,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何文徵山斋杂咏 其三 御风台","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"高台望不极，万里御雄风。\n旬日那能返，泠然天地中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33123,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何文徵山斋杂咏 其四 柳堤","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"垂垂千树柳，风动曲尘丝。\n费尽春时絮，堤前赠别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33124,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"独坐檐宇间，林端瓷清赏。\n空山日落时，满屋秋虫响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33125,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"天地亦已大，斯人何苦心。\n把酒语不得，西风吹上林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33126,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"散步出西堰，迤移山路长。\n秋兰漫堪采，赠子为衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33127,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂咏 其四","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"檐前暑渐稀，闲窗梦初醒。\n风动金琅珰，爽然发清警。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33128,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋中杂咏 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"风来万树动，月出半山白。\n谁家吹笛郎，骑牛过西陌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33129,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋中杂咏 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"城头折葛花，一朵如鸳鸯。\n莫漫怜芳采，相牵亦太长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33130,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清吹台作","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"倒景射长林，翠色染树下。\n流水浅复清，幽人坐如画。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登清吹台再别良倩","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"别意写不尽，登高再送君。\n寂莫一分手，秋风吹白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33132,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦雁图 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"萧萧芦荻秋，水色净于雪。\n西风吹雁群，点破寒江月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33133,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦雁图 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"乘风发衡阳，徘徊此秋色。\n不因寄书来，休误上林翼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33134,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怨诗 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"明星当大路，旭日照长林。\n晨起坐房室，秋风吹我襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33135,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怨诗 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"秋风一何寒，江路一何遥。\n良人远离别，遇风如蓬飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33136,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怨诗 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"昔年君别妾，江上春风早。\n今日妾思君，秋庭生秋草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33137,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日即事 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"胧胧曙日露初晞，打鼓鸣锣候晓归。\n万橹一时同下濑，乘流千顷浪花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33138,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日即事 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"旌旗冉冉下长川，便可乘风直上天。\n一路澄江回素练，水中山色棹中烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33139,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甘竹滩","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"飘风急雨夜深回，滩上云涛涨不开。\n薄曙片帆低欲度，雪山无数蹴天来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33140,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江雨","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"海风吹浪雨冥冥，江上龙鳞跃欲灵。\n可便相将吊湘水，暮天回首数峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33141,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔舟","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"银丝金错滩水西，出水鲥鱼带露携。\n渔人爱惜不忍卖，作鲙临江花满堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33142,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春词 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"东风吹柳柳丝斜，翠幕朱栏千树花。\n几处红楼醉歌舞，日高犹自宿娼家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33143,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春词 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"今年春事太相催，夹道迎风锦帐开。\n为问括香诸使者，明朝应见惜花来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"玉轮珠箔驾青牛，少女如花坐上头。\n歌入彩云还不见，月明笑语在西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山斋煮茶 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"晓城风雨晚城霞，白石清溪处士家。\n高卧北窗慵不起，木兰花下教煎茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山斋煮茶 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"四月穿绵五月裘，由来片月喘吴牛。\n那应别有清凉界，七椀乘风到上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"制观梅服 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"吴丝清迥玉生光，裁作观梅世外装。\n粗拙未妨田舍气，独防薰着麝芸香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"制观梅服 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"从来喘月度年华，六月羊裘上钓槎。\n独此不须多送暖，欲令清冷象梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"制观梅服 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"纷纷车马折花来，此俗吾乡自有梅。\n不是野人新制服，年年清福为谁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日郊行偶成","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"霏霏烟雨泛平田，万壑空濛在眼前。\n水碧山青浑不断，风光今日是新年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中作","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"一榻翛然坐不移，夜凉空馆寂观时。\n身如野鹤心如水，不是幽人谁得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞燕","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"金霞帐里倚新妆，独捧冰壶侍御床。\n多少愁心关不住，夜随明月出昭阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思三首 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"高楼晓日澹龙光，南陌何人出采桑。\n强欲嗣音愁不那，罗敷憔悴使君傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思三首 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"长门深锁月华光，清殿无人兰茝香。\n浪说长卿原薄倖，何因词赋感君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思三首 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"沟水东流春日阴，因君试诵白头吟。\n茂陵少女休相讶，自是当时误弄琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠歌者","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"写得修眉翠欲重，笑回双颊艳芙蓉。\n朝来倘便乘云去，知在巫山第几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33157,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"剪将云锦竞芳春，月影如眉不耐新。\n准备明霄足灯火，隔帘相待赏花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33158,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"清歌连袂踏春回，选得鞦韆胜地开。\n早晚场中施綵缕，玉人亲手送将来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33159,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"画烛沉沉动玉楼，佳人初御紫云裘。\n自怜灯好千金值，犹恐春阴不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33160,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其四","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"九夜渐晴天渐光，十一月华明似霜。\n纷纷弦管踏灯去，陌上绮罗空断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33161,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其五","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"灯事寻常南陌头，烟花簇簇漾中流。\n今年春色絪缊甚，万怪千祇事冶游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33162,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其六","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"颈珠缭绕发䰐鬖，界道金绳照宝龛。\n冉冉红莲双拥护，灯前提出小鱼篮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33163,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其七","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"紫陌烟晴杨柳新，青丝千缕扑香尘。\n谁家女伴鞦韆下，竞折长条调笑人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33164,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其八","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"春风月上画楼时，楼上仙人肉胜丝。\n唱出一声新乐府，一时争和竹枝词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33165,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕杂咏 其九","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"从来三五月如珠，底事春光今夜殊。\n爇尽沉香待乘兴，不堪银箭下金壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33166,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古踏灯词 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"灯烟一带紫光斜，何处新妆踏落花。\n前面金莲双綵烛，行人知是五侯家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33167,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古踏灯词 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"溪光摇荡锦云开，夹道惊传凤辇来。\n十里红尘遮不断，五陵诸少打毬回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33168,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘君堂前紫菊忽生黄花三朵萧君为索赠 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"数朵东篱画不如，百灵移植重吹嘘。\n坐令王母金光草，飞入仙人紫雾裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33169,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘君堂前紫菊忽生黄花三朵萧君为索赠 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"紫烟漠漠晚枝寒，映月含霜逼夜阑。\n却怪谁家三妇艳，并将黄额倚阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33170,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉花台坐月听东邻美人吹箫 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"青山隐映翠云遥，清夜高台坐寂寥。\n何处碧桃深院里，月明风送紫鸾箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33171,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉花台坐月听东邻美人吹箫 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"谁将幽怨写清光，一曲秦楼月似霜。\n翠幕珠帘深不见，空馀幽韵满衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉花台坐月听东邻美人吹箫 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"高台夜久露凄霏，仙侣秦楼归未归。\n我更断肠听不得，愿随双凤梦中飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"春绡清映玉生光，画出林塘云水香。\n千片红莲万枝柳，中流争羡紫鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"鸳鸯对浴复同栖，翠羽红衣恋夕晖。\n碧海三山君不见，纵令骑凤亦双飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"玄都玉府信清娱，三鸟西来数寄书。\n试问鸳鸯如许事，凤情鸾想近何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其四","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"芙蓉城里起春风，小玉云英自掌中。\n得似在梁双比翼，月明烟暖水花红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其五","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"应怜彩翼弄春茵，玉沼银塘夜夜亲。\n一曲霓裳君莫管，珊瑚同树更无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其六","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"云林女伴踏歌来，仙桂灵芝满目开。\n闻说此中誇胜事，月明双跨綵鸳回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其七","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"相怜相伴小洲前，紫府离今不记年。\n曾是玉皇亲手戏，教来双作水中仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为友人题鸳鸯图赠女道士 其八","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"身前身后总茫如，跨鹤骖鸾路有馀。\n安得随君化鸳侣，双双来往步清虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古艳词 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"疏钟凉月晚辉辉，仙子乘春夜未归。\n忽遇秦楼双彩凤，招摇齐向玉京飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古艳词 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"窈窕银塘花树深，新开绣阁倚层阴。\n美人笑指东窗下，叶落花开夜夜心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花叹","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"朱楼日暖小桃红，今日蛾眉画不同。\n落尽春光君不见，倚阑空自待东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"吹笛江头夜半时，新声清切泪堪挥。\n故园应有梅花落，何得因风满客衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏答李伯襄 其一","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"思君频忆早梅芳，垂袖临风望月光。\n自是君心不如月，却教零露满衣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏答李伯襄 其二","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"暖风微雨昼迷冥，深院无人处处莺。\n未必诏华从此掷，不须愁怨却悲鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33187,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏答李伯襄 其三","author":"伍瑞隆","text":"春潮初落大江平，日暮浮尊爽气生。\n无限中洲生杜若，塞芳何处不逢迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":33188,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]